      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Udi ario ma jocegin gi Ot pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jacwo no oteran i diedipo ma woko, aka otelan i geto ma yumalo ma Ot pa Were, ma kibor gi geto ma yuwok ceŋ i gike ma Ot pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geto me oyido obedo mita piero abic i boro kodi mita piero ario g'abic i laco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thenge acel oŋiyo hongo ma mita apar i laco m'oyido nitie i bol acel gi Ot pa Were. I thenge man oŋiyo daraja ma diedipo ma woko. Oyido ogeti i gorofa adek, aka kisi acel oyido bor loyo ma pende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thenge ma yumalo ma geto nitie kalikondi ma mita abic i laco kodi mita piero abic i boro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikin ma malo ma geto oyido diny loyo ma diere kodi ma pende kwoŋbedo gorofa jotero kwoŋ jo hongo madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikin oyido nitie i gorofa adek je, aka oyido jongoye gi sirin paka geto man i diedipo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie kor ot m'otire gi kisikin, yu diedipo ma woko, m'oŋiyere gi kisikin, mita piero ario g'abic i boro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisikin ma diedipo ma woko oyido obedo mita piero ario g'abic i boro, aka m'oŋiyere gi Ot pa Were oyido obedo mita piero abic i boro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I tiendi kisikin me oyido nitie kalikondi m'idonjo gine wok yuwok ceŋ t'iwok i diedipo ma woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie kisikin i thenge ma yupiny, ma boro mere obedo boro ma kor ot ma woko, ma riwere gi diedipo aka oŋiyere gi kor ot ma woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuwaŋ kisikin oyido nitie kalikondi ma cale gi manitie i thenge ma yumalo. Boro kodi laco mere oyido jorom gi dhiote can kodi thigin ma cale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thigin ma kisikin yupiny oyido donjere gi dhiot ma yuwaŋ kalikondi m'oŋiyere gine, wok yuwok ceŋ, kama kor ot caker'iye gine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacwo no owaco ran ni, kisikin ma yumalo kodi kisikin ma yupiny m'oŋiyere gi diedipo jobedo maleŋ. Kenyo ama jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jobino ruwaŋ Rwoth jolacamo mic maleŋ loyo. Kenyo jolaketho iye mic maleŋ loyo, mic ma cemo, mic ma cwako reco, kodi mic ma cul kwoŋbedo kabedo no leŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jocway ri Were i wi migam jodonjo i Kabedo Maleŋ, jokiripi wok i diedipo ma woko ma jok'olunyo woko law ma joruko kwoŋbedo jobedo maleŋ. Joripo ruko nangin man mafodi jok'ocore cegin gi kama ji jocokere iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rapim ma iy Ot pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jacwo no otieko kipima iy Ot pa Were, go otelan woko gi waŋkac ma ŋiyo yuwok ceŋ, aka opima woko ma Ot pa Were thoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go opima yuwok ceŋ gi kedi, mita 250. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owire to pima thenge ma yumalo gi kedi, mita 250. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owire i thenge ma yupiny gi kedi, to pima mita 250. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owire i thenge ma yupodho ceŋ gi kedi, to pima mita 250 i thenge aŋwen je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kor ot oyido nitie thoko mita 250 i boro kodi mita 250 i laco, ma ketho pokirok i dier gimaleŋ kodi gima kileŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
